i_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"So, between strong growth in royalties that are driven between v8 to v9, all things AI needing energy efficient compute and compute subsystems, we feel very, very strongly positioned for growth.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/07/arm-holdings-arm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2024 Q3","e":"arm","d":"2024-02-07","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Jason Child","x":"As with recent quarters, we expect to sign multiple new ATA deals in Q4, and demand for our latest technology remains high as customers need access to AI-capable CPUs and related technology, such as our compute subsystems.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/07/arm-holdings-arm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2024 Q3","e":"arm","d":"2024-02-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"And to that end, we've also raised guidance in which Jason is going to give more color on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/02/07/arm-holdings-arm-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2024 Q4","e":"arm","d":"2024-05-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"Royalties up 37% year on year, and this is really driven by acceleration of v9 adoption, which I'll speak about a little bit more; and also licensing up 60% year on year, which is really a function of increased R&D investment to capture the huge opportunity that is all things AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/arm-holdings-arm-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2024 Q4","e":"arm","d":"2024-05-08","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"I would say one of the dynamics that has changed a bit since we chatted, and I think a positive for us, is the increased investment in the data center around all things AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/05/08/arm-holdings-arm-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2025 Q1","e":"arm","d":"2024-07-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"That was record license revenue, up 70% year on year as companies continue to invest in Arm for AI everywhere.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/31/arm-holdings-arm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2025 Q1","e":"arm","d":"2024-07-31","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"…benefits we're also getting that's driving increased licensing activity is the fact that these AI data centers are largely custom, meaning that the blades, the racks, the interconnect, everything associated with building an AI data center is different each time, which leads its way to…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/31/arm-holdings-arm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2025 Q1","e":"arm","d":"2024-07-31","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Child","x":"We reiterate our outlook for ACV growth in the low double digits for the year, which reflects durable demand for Arm's latest IP.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/07/31/arm-holdings-arm-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2025 Q2","e":"arm","d":"2024-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"The demand for AI everywhere is increasing the demand for Arm's Compute platform.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/arm-holdings-arm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2025 Q2","e":"arm","d":"2024-11-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"We had continued strong Licensing revenue, showing that our customers are continuing to invest in the future of AI in an AI everywhere world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/arm-holdings-arm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2025 Q2","e":"arm","d":"2024-11-06","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Child","x":"The one thing I think -- I think we've said in the past, just to make sure it's clear is with ATA, the annual costs or price increase is roughly 7% per year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/arm-holdings-arm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2025 Q2","e":"arm","d":"2024-11-06","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Jason Child","x":"Looking out to fiscal year '25, we are reiterating our guidance for revenue, cost, and profit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2024/11/06/arm-holdings-arm-q2-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2025 Q3","e":"arm","d":"2025-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"AI growth requires significantly more compute across all of our end markets from smartphones with better chat features, to autos with better driving and parking assist, to IoT microprocessors with embedded NPUs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/05/arm-holdings-arm-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2025 Q3","e":"arm","d":"2025-02-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"Along with SoftBank Group and OpenAI, Stargate for AI infrastructure deployment, and advanced enterprise AI called Cristal intelligence to develop AI agents for knowledge work.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/02/05/arm-holdings-arm-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2026 Q2","e":"arm","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"We continue its fiscal year 2026 with strong momentum, fueled by accelerating demand for AI compute from milliwatts in the smallest of edge devices to megawatts in the world's largest hyperscale data centers.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/arm-arm-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2026 Q2","e":"arm","d":"2025-11-05","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"Artificial intelligence is reshaping every layer of technology, and Arm Holdings plc American Depositary Shares is the only compute platform delivering AI everywhere.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/arm-arm-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2026 Q2","e":"arm","d":"2025-11-05","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Child","x":"Our higher revenue allows us to both accelerate R&D investment and pass through upside to EPS.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/11/05/arm-arm-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2026 Q3","e":"arm","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"Royalties increased 27% to a record $737 million, driven by record units with strength across AI and general-purpose data center.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/arm-holdings-arm-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2026 Q3","e":"arm","d":"2026-02-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"AI is changing how compute is built and where it runs across cloud infrastructure, edge devices, and physical systems.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/04/arm-holdings-arm-q3-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2026 Q4","e":"arm","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"Royalty revenue grew 11% to $671 million, with growth across Edge AI, Physical AI and Cloud AI, where our data center royalty has more than doubled year-over-year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/arm-arm-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2026 Q4","e":"arm","d":"2026-05-06","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"As Agentic AI scales, data centers will require more than 4x today's CPU capacity, creating a data center CPU market opportunity of more than $100 billion by 2030.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/arm-arm-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2026 Q4","e":"arm","d":"2026-05-06","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Jason Child","x":"However, we are maintaining our outlook of $1 billion while we pursue supply chain capacity, and we still expect the first revenues from production chip sales to land in the fourth quarter of this fiscal year.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/07/arm-arm-q4-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2027 Q1","e":"arm","d":"2026-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"Our results reflect growing demand for the Arm compute platform as AI expands across cloud infrastructure, edge devices and the physical world.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/arm-arm-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2027 Q1","e":"arm","d":"2026-07-29","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"AI is changing where and how compute happens.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/arm-arm-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2027 Q1","e":"arm","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Jason Child","x":"Obviously, with some of the price increases and things that have happened, we're still kind of working through how to digest those and what needs to be kind of -- what needs to affect our pricing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/arm-arm-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2027 Q1","e":"arm","d":"2026-07-29","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Sebastien Cyrus Naji","x":"They're starting to raise prices.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/07/arm-arm-q1-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2027 Q2","e":"arm","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"Non-GAAP earnings per share increased 33% to $0.52, while we continue to increase our investment in R&D. AI is driving unprecedented demand for compute across the cloud, devices, and autonomous systems, with Arm being the compute platform of choice.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/arm-holdings-arm-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2027 Q2","e":"arm","d":"2026-11-04","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rene Haas","x":"Beyond the data center, Arm's role in edge AI increases as AI agents become more capable and persistent.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/arm-holdings-arm-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"ARM 2027 Q2","e":"arm","d":"2026-11-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Joe Quatrochi","x":"Can you just talk about your ability to offset those higher costs, pass that through to customers in terms of pricing, and then the puts and takes on gross margin?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/arm-holdings-arm-q2-2027-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[55,1,10404,0,0,0,7039,2823],[56,1,6874,0,0,0,4668,1757],[57,1,7349,0,0,0,5495,1313],[58,1,6528,0,0,0,4860,1241],[59,1,6616,0,0,0,3896,2253],[60,1,6953,0,0,0,5114,1343],[63,1,5749,0,0,0,4295,876],[64,1,7022,0,0,0,5151,1186],[65,1,6710,0,0,0,5458,915],[66,1,6767,0,0,0,5211,1142],[67,1,6798,0,0,0,5114,1221]],"cinema":[[55,1,10404,0,0,0,7039,2823],[56,1,6874,0,0,0,4668,1757],[57,1,7349,0,0,0,5495,1313],[58,1,6528,0,0,0,4860,1241],[59,1,6616,0,0,0,3896,2253],[60,1,6953,0,0,0,5114,1343],[63,1,5749,0,0,0,4295,876],[64,1,7022,0,0,0,5151,1186],[65,1,6710,0,0,0,5458,915],[66,1,6767,0,0,0,5211,1142],[67,1,6798,0,0,0,5114,1221]],"imax":[[55,1,10404,0,0,0,7039,2823],[56,1,6874,0,0,0,4668,1757],[57,1,7349,0,0,0,5495,1313],[58,1,6528,0,0,0,4860,1241],[59,1,6616,0,0,0,3896,2253],[60,1,6953,0,0,0,5114,1343],[63,1,5749,0,0,0,4295,876],[64,1,7022,0,0,0,5151,1186],[65,1,6710,0,0,0,5458,915],[66,1,6767,0,0,0,5211,1142],[67,1,6798,0,0,0,5114,1221]],"streaming":[[55,1,10404,0,0,0,7039,2823],[56,1,6874,0,0,0,4668,1757],[57,1,7349,0,0,0,5495,1313],[58,1,6528,0,0,0,4860,1241],[59,1,6616,0,0,0,3896,2253],[60,1,6953,0,0,0,5114,1343],[63,1,5749,0,0,0,4295,876],[64,1,7022,0,0,0,5151,1186],[65,1,6710,0,0,0,5458,915],[66,